  "Tool poisoning": "工具投毒",
  "Tool descriptions go straight into the model's context. A malicious server can hide instructions in them, or change them after you approved it.": "工具描述会直接进入模型的上下文。恶意服务器可以在里面藏指令，或者在你批准之后再改掉它们。",
  "Prompt injection": "提示注入",
  "Tool results can carry text anyone wrote, like an issue body or a web page. The model may follow it as if you asked.": "工具结果里可能有任何人写的文字，比如 issue 正文或网页。模型可能照着做，就像是你让它做的。",
  "Token passthrough": "令牌透传",
  "A token must be issued for this server and never forwarded upstream. A proxy that skips per-client consent can hand your access to someone else.": "令牌必须是签发给这个服务器的，绝不能转发给上游。跳过逐客户端同意的代理，可能把你的访问权限交给别人。",
  "Elicitation phishing": "征询钓鱼",
  "A server can ask the user for input. It must never ask for secrets in a form, and a link must show its real domain before it opens.": "服务器可以向用户索要输入。它绝不能用表单索要机密信息，链接在打开前必须显示真实域名。",
  "Tool shadowing": "工具遮蔽",
  "Every server's descriptions share one context, so one server can tell the model how to use another server's tools.": "所有服务器的描述共享同一个上下文，所以一个服务器可以告诉模型怎么用另一个服务器的工具。"
